// Copy to appex/Local.xcconfig (gitignored) to build this machine's
// extras into CodeSaver. BuildNumber.xcconfig includes it if it exists, so
// install.sh and Xcode pick it up; ./build.sh reads the same line for
// build/feeds-check. scripts/release.sh blanks these conditions on its
// command line, so they never reach a published release.
//
//   HOME_CONTROL   now playing falls back to a pair of HomePods on a
//                  home-control bus when this Mac plays nothing, and the
//                  saver sends the bus its "watching" heartbeat while it
//                  shows them. Reads the bus key and token from the login
//                  Keychain (service "home-control") through
//                  /usr/bin/security.
//   LEGACY_SPOOLS  the widget feed also reads bifrocate's spools in
//                  ~/.bifrocate/cot for a session without the claude-mods
//                  live file.
//
// $(inherited) keeps anything set before this file; the project's Debug
// configuration adds DEBUG on top either way. Drop a flag from the line to
// build without it; delete the file to build exactly what a release ships.
SWIFT_ACTIVE_COMPILATION_CONDITIONS = $(inherited) HOME_CONTROL LEGACY_SPOOLS
